    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Päär I-jëp kɛ jiath thëëp",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ kä kɛl kä pay in diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn, kɛ wälkɛl runi mëë ta̱kɔ pɛɛcä, cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gat ran ruacni kɛ kuäär I-jëp ni Pɛro kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ jio̱kni jɛ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cu Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial ruac kɛ wee i̱, “Jɛn jiath cɛ piith a bär a ci biɛɛdɛ cop ni pua̱a̱ri, kä cɛ rɔ cu liak kɛ bärɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cä jɛ la̱th tetni rueecä dööri, kɛ ɣöö bɛ jɛ lätkä mi päär kɛ nyuɔɔnkɛ. Ɣän cä jɛ yuɔr dɔɔr kɛ kui̱ jiäknikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi jur tin bɛc nikɛn kä döör jɛ jɔap piny kä ba jɛ ba̱ny piny. Kä bi karkɛ pɛn wi̱i̱ päämni kɛnɛ rɛy löli diaal. Kä bi ji̱thkɛ te rɛy pi̱i̱ni a cikɛ töl, kä bi döör wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n diaal jiɛɛn ti̱pädɛ ba jɛ ba̱ny piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kui̱ kä ti̱ti̱ diaal ɛ ɣöö bɛ thil jiath mi bi rɔ lɛ nyɔk kɛ liak kɛ bärɛ kä jiɛn tin pith gekä pi̱i̱ni, mi bi biɛɛdɛ pua̱a̱r cop. Kä thilɛ jiath mi dɔ̱ŋ mi bi bär ce̱tkɛ jɛ kä jiɛn tin ca wac agɔaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ ci Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial wee i̱, “Kɛ jɛn cäŋ ɔ ba kony ni jɛ mɔ, bä mun kɔ̱a̱kdɛ muɔl thi̱n a bɛ jɛ kum. Kä bäkɛ kum kä bä pi̱w yiëërɛ cu ka̱p cuɔ̱ŋ, a bi pi̱kɛ tin ŋuan cu thuɔ̱k. Ɣän bä Lɛ-ba-nɔn moc kɛ bieyni pärä kɛ ɣöö paarɛ jiath, kä jiɛn diaal tin te piny wec parkɛ jɛ bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ döör jakä lathɛ kɛ jɔw pɛɛnä jiaath, mëë jakä jɛ kä li̱w kɛɛl kɛ jɔɔk. Kä ka̱a̱k Kuɔth diaal kɛ mɛ̈ɛ̈k jiɛn Lɛ-ba-nɔn tin gɔw, kɛ jiɛn diaal tëë ca wac agɔaa, bakɛ wä bum ni muun jɔɔkni pinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛy tëë cieŋ ti̱pädɛ, kɛnɛ nɛy tëë ci mat kɛ jɛ rɛy dööri, cikɛ li̱w kɛɛl kɛ jɛ, cikɛ rɔ̱ ma̱t nɛy tëë ca näk ko̱o̱r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ɛ jiath in mith kä jiɛn E-dɛn päär wuɔ̱tdɛ kɛnɛ gɔɔydɛ kɛ ji̱ mɔ? Täämɛ ji̱n yɛnɛ jiɛn E-dɛn ba yɛ naŋ ro̱o̱l jɔɔkni pinyi. Bi rɔ ma̱t nɛy tin /ci tɔ̱a̱ nɛɛ Kuɔth, nɛy tëë ca näk ko̱o̱r. Kä jɛn jiath ɛmɛ ɛ Kuäär I-jëp ni Pɛro kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal, ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
